ed with the use of AI.<br>I would love to work with an artist, but I don't have the budget yet.</p>", "short_description": "🏝️ A tropical fantasy fishing RPG. 🐠 Reel in rare fish and story-rich treasures from different universes. 🐉 Help a dragon whelp to transform into a fully grown dragon. 🏆 And compare your collection with your friends!", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/16af1cfddfbb1033e14bb55fd3d4e85749e592b8/header.jpg?t=1768541850", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/283da54e74c5b655e3e85997b1d200082975991a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768541850", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907050/283da54e74c5b655e3e85997b1d200082975991a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768541850", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GT 520<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Toprogress Studio"], "publishers": ["Toprogress Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternatives"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 76, "description": "Mouse Only Option"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 77, "description": "Touch Only Option"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genre